The current head eb94837a7dd05b8daa17e33db8fae16e60ddea6f only adds the requested L0 marker; the previously qualified production source is unchanged. The six binding-rejection cases now pass under -m L0.

Both earlier a852a4c requests failed before pipeline creation. This is one request for the updated head; if startup fails again, please inspect the CI bot log rather than interpreting it as a test failure.

@cudnn-ci-bot run python/sdpa/frost

